p ceiling error.\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\",\n      \"impact\": \"LP fee growth slightly understated per multi-tick swap. Protocol slightly overpaid. Max loss per swap: N wei where N = number of tick crossings. Not directly exploitable for value extraction by a swapper, but a pool owner with high protocolFeeBPS could systematically drain N wei per tick per"}}]}
